{
  "id": "project-start",
  "name": {
    "en": "Project start (value map first)",
    "ru": "Старт проекта (сначала карта ценности)"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Starts work on a project: a value map before any question (who it is for, what they get, how we know), a preview of the stack, the tests and the memory it already has, the infra profile, the owner's working style and risk, then a recap with next steps and the roadmap skeleton.",
    "ru": "Начинает работу над проектом: карта ценности до любых вопросов (для кого, что получают, как узнаем), обзор стека, тестов и уже накопленной памяти, профиль инфраструктуры, стиль работы владельца и риск, затем итог со следующими шагами и каркасом дорожной карты."
  },
  "category": "planning",
  "examples": {
    "ru": [
      "Начни работу над новым проектом",
      "Разберись в проекте с нуля и предложи план",
      "Сделай карту ценности проекта",
      "Подготовь старт: стек, тесты, память, инфраструктура"
    ],
    "en": [
      "Start work on a new project",
      "Get to know the project from scratch and propose a plan",
      "Build the project's value map",
      "Prepare the start: stack, tests, memory, infra"
    ]
  },
  "not_for": [],
  "status": "published",
  "inputs": {
    "project_cwd": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "outputs": {
    "status": "done|resumed",
    "value_map": "string",
    "next_steps": "string[]",
    "refused": "string[]"
  },
  "quality_mode": {
    "default": "standard"
  },
  "requires": {
    "plugins": [
      "lane-pilot"
    ]
  },
  "budget": {
    "max_minutes": 90
  },
  "entry": "tree",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "tree",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "lp.tree_counts",
      "title": {
        "en": "What the tree counts (only with project.start_research on)",
        "ru": "Что считает дерево (только при project.start_research = on)"
      },
      "out": {
        "enabled": "string",
        "sources": "int",
        "tests": "int",
        "docs": "int",
        "planning": "int",
        "commits": "int",
        "counts_note": "string",
        "profile_note": "string",
        "recap_note": "string"
      },
      "params": {
        "counts_note": "Open VALUE-MAP.md with these five lines counted from the tree itself, verbatim:",
        "profile_note": "For this run, do not run any external profile CLI yourself: return the infra profile as the JSON object `profile` (key: value) with only these keys: stack, test_command, release, hosts, start, deploy, logs, style; the next step stores it as the project's profile settings with the one profile writer, which refuses secrets and any other key (the same settings `bb lane-pilot profile` reads and sets).",
        "recap_note": "Read .agents/planning/research/STACK.md, FEATURES.md, ARCHITECTURE.md and PITFALLS.md and the requirements before the roadmap, and build the roadmap skeleton from the requirements. In project_document return the raw Markdown of .agents/planning/PROJECT.md built from VALUE-MAP.md: Vision, Value and Limits (the no-gos and the risks the anamnesis names); the code-owned writer persists it — an existing file is left byte for byte and the new text lands in PROJECT.new.md next to it."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "probe",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "lp.state_probe",
      "title": {
        "en": "What already exists",
        "ru": "Что уже есть"
      },
      "out": {
        "has_passport": "bool",
        "open_tasks": "int",
        "plan_exists": "bool",
        "has_ui": "bool",
        "has_value_map": "bool",
        "has_roadmap": "bool",
        "has_profile": "bool"
      },
      "skip_when": "tree.enabled != 'on'",
      "skip_out": {
        "has_passport": false,
        "open_tasks": 0,
        "plan_exists": false,
        "has_ui": false,
        "has_value_map": false,
        "has_roadmap": false,
        "has_profile": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "value_map",
      "type": "agent",
      "role": "analyst",
      "title": {
        "en": "Value map",
        "ru": "Карта ценности"
      },
      "prompt": "Value map builder, before asking anything: from README, the passport (project-onboard), the site and the code — who the product is for, the job they hire it for, what they get, how we would know it works. Return the complete raw Markdown of VALUE-MAP.md in document; the code-owned writer persists it to .agents/planning/. This read-only helper does not write files. {{tree.counts_note}}",
      "out": {
        "document": "string"
      },
      "guards": {
        "maxVisits": 1,
        "timeoutMin": 25
      },
      "produces": [
        {
          "kind": "report",
          "version": 1
        }
      ],
      "skip_when": "probe.has_value_map",
      "skip_out": {
        "document": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "preview",
      "type": "agent",
      "role": "analyst",
      "title": {
        "en": "Stack, tests, memory preview",
        "ru": "Стек, тесты, память"
      },
      "prompt": "Stack and tests: languages, frameworks, the test command and whether it is green. Memory preview: report what the <project_memory> block of this brief holds (the hub corpus's confirmed notes of this project; no block means the corpus holds nothing yet); write nothing to memory. Infra profile: return hosts, start, deploy, logs in profile for lp.profile_write (the one profile writer). {{tree.profile_note}}",
      "out": {
        "stack": "any",
        "memory": "any",
        "profile": "any?"
      },
      "guards": {
        "maxVisits": 1,
        "timeoutMin": 25
      },
      "produces": [
        {
          "kind": "report",
          "version": 1
        }
      ],
      "consumes": [
        {
          "kind": "report",
          "version": 1,
          "from": "value_map"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "profile_write",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "lp.profile_write",
      "title": {
        "en": "The one profile writer",
        "ru": "Единственный писатель профиля"
      },
      "params": {
        "profile": "{{preview.profile}}"
      },
      "out": {
        "refused": "string[]",
        "set": "string[]",
        "reasons": "string[]"
      },
      "skip_when": "tree.enabled != 'on'",
      "skip_out": {
        "refused": [],
        "set": [],
        "reasons": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ask",
      "type": "human",
      "role": "owner",
      "title": {
        "en": "What is still missing",
        "ru": "Чего ещё не хватает"
      },
      "skip_when": "tree.enabled != 'on' || probe.has_profile",
      "skip_out": {
        "answer": "",
        "answer_kind": "answered"
      },
      "prompt": "Ask only for the fields still missing, at most five questions: audience, constraints, stack, money, deadline. No answer is a timeout — the run proceeds with the stated assumptions.",
      "out": {
        "answer": "string",
        "answer_kind": "answered|timeout"
      },
      "guards": {
        "maxVisits": 1,
        "timeoutMin": 240
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "research",
      "type": "agent",
      "role": "specialist:tavily",
      "title": {
        "en": "Research before the roadmap",
        "ru": "Исследование до дорожной карты"
      },
      "applicable_modes": [
        "standard",
        "full"
      ],
      "skip_out": {
        "research_notes": "",
        "stack": "",
        "features": "",
        "architecture": "",
        "pitfalls": ""
      },
      "prompt": "Research competitors and conventions for what the project is, from the value map and the owner's answers. Return four documents in stack, features, architecture and pitfalls — each with its sources and what the roadmap should take from it; the code-owned writers persist them as .agents/planning/research/STACK.md, FEATURES.md, ARCHITECTURE.md and PITFALLS.md. A file that already exists is never overwritten: the writer leaves it byte for byte and puts the new text in <name>.new.md next to it.",
      "out": {
        "research_notes": "string",
        "stack": "string",
        "features": "string",
        "architecture": "string",
        "pitfalls": "string"
      },
      "guards": {
        "maxVisits": 1,
        "timeoutMin": 25
      },
      "produces": [
        {
          "kind": "report",
          "version": 1
        }
      ],
      "skip_when": "tree.enabled != 'on' || $mode == 'quick'"
    },
    {
      "id": "requirements",
      "type": "agent",
      "role": "planner",
      "title": {
        "en": "Requirements",
        "ru": "Требования"
      },
      "prompt": "From the goal, the value map, the answers and the research: 3-7 requirements with ids — return the raw Markdown requirements block in document (the way new-milestone writes them); the code-owned writer appends it to .agents/planning/REQUIREMENTS.md, keeping what is already there. This read-only helper does not write files.",
      "out": {
        "requirements": "string[]",
        "document": "string"
      },
      "guards": {
        "maxVisits": 1,
        "timeoutMin": 25
      },
      "produces": [
        {
          "kind": "report",
          "version": 1
        }
      ],
      "skip_when": "tree.enabled != 'on' || $mode == 'quick'",
      "skip_out": {
        "requirements": [],
        "document": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "recap",
      "type": "agent",
      "role": "planner",
      "title": {
        "en": "Recap and next steps",
        "ru": "Итог и шаги"
      },
      "prompt": "Working style and risk from the owner's anamnesis. Recap in five lines and three next steps, plus the roadmap skeleton as raw Markdown in roadmap_draft (phases in order; the code-owned writer persists it to .agents/planning/ROADMAP.md and registers the phases as roadmap rows — return them in phases too). This read-only helper does not write files and runs no lane-plan commands. {{tree.recap_note}}",
      "out": {
        "next_steps": "string[]",
        "roadmap_draft": "string",
        "project_document": "string?",
        "phases": "string[]"
      },
      "guards": {
        "maxVisits": 1,
        "timeoutMin": 25
      },
      "produces": [
        {
          "kind": "report",
          "version": 1
        }
      ],
      "consumes": [
        {
          "kind": "report",
          "version": 1,
          "from": "value_map"
        },
        {
          "kind": "report",
          "version": 1,
          "from": "preview"
        },
        {
          "kind": "report",
          "version": 1,
          "required": false,
          "from": "requirements"
        }
      ],
      "skip_when": "probe.has_roadmap",
      "skip_out": {
        "next_steps": [],
        "roadmap_draft": "",
        "project_document": "",
        "phases": "[]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "done",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "emit",
      "map": {
        "status": "done",
        "value_map": "value_map.document",
        "next_steps": "recap.next_steps",
        "refused": "profile_write.refused"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "resumed",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "emit",
      "map": {
        "status": "resumed",
        "value_map": "''",
        "next_steps": "['the project is already started — continue with project-resume']",
        "refused": "[]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "write_value_map",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "fs.write",
      "out": {
        "value_map_path": "string"
      },
      "title": {
        "en": "Write the value map",
        "ru": "Записать карту ценности"
      },
      "skip_when": "!value_map.document",
      "skip_out": {
        "value_map_path": ""
      },
      "mode": "non_overwrite",
      "params": {
        "path": ".agents/planning/VALUE-MAP.md",
        "contents": "{{value_map.document}}",
        "mode": "non_overwrite"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "write_requirements",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "fs.write",
      "out": {
        "requirements_path": "string"
      },
      "mode": "non_overwrite",
      "title": {
        "en": "Append the requirements",
        "ru": "Дописать требования"
      },
      "skip_when": "!requirements.document",
      "skip_out": {
        "requirements_path": ""
      },
      "params": {
        "path": ".agents/planning/REQUIREMENTS.md",
        "contents": "{{requirements.document}}",
        "mode": "non_overwrite"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "write_roadmap",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "fs.write",
      "out": {
        "roadmap_path": "string"
      },
      "title": {
        "en": "Write the roadmap skeleton",
        "ru": "Записать скелет дорожной карты"
      },
      "skip_when": "!recap.roadmap_draft",
      "skip_out": {
        "roadmap_path": ""
      },
      "mode": "non_overwrite",
      "params": {
        "path": ".agents/planning/ROADMAP.md",
        "contents": "{{recap.roadmap_draft}}",
        "mode": "non_overwrite"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "write_research_stack",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "fs.write",
      "mode": "non_overwrite",
      "out": {
        "research_path": "string"
      },
      "skip_when": "!research.stack",
      "skip_out": {
        "research_path": ""
      },
      "title": {
        "en": "Write research STACK.md",
        "ru": "Записать исследование STACK.md"
      },
      "params": {
        "path": ".agents/planning/research/STACK.md",
        "contents": "{{research.stack}}",
        "mode": "non_overwrite"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "write_research_features",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "fs.write",
      "mode": "non_overwrite",
      "out": {
        "research_path": "string"
      },
      "skip_when": "!research.features",
      "skip_out": {
        "research_path": ""
      },
      "title": {
        "en": "Write research FEATURES.md",
        "ru": "Записать исследование FEATURES.md"
      },
      "params": {
        "path": ".agents/planning/research/FEATURES.md",
        "contents": "{{research.features}}",
        "mode": "non_overwrite"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "write_research_architecture",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "fs.write",
      "mode": "non_overwrite",
      "out": {
        "research_path": "string"
      },
      "skip_when": "!research.architecture",
      "skip_out": {
        "research_path": ""
      },
      "title": {
        "en": "Write research ARCHITECTURE.md",
        "ru": "Записать исследование ARCHITECTURE.md"
      },
      "params": {
        "path": ".agents/planning/research/ARCHITECTURE.md",
        "contents": "{{research.architecture}}",
        "mode": "non_overwrite"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "write_research_pitfalls",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "fs.write",
      "mode": "non_overwrite",
      "out": {
        "research_path": "string"
      },
      "skip_when": "!research.pitfalls",
      "skip_out": {
        "research_path": ""
      },
      "title": {
        "en": "Write research PITFALLS.md",
        "ru": "Записать исследование PITFALLS.md"
      },
      "params": {
        "path": ".agents/planning/research/PITFALLS.md",
        "contents": "{{research.pitfalls}}",
        "mode": "non_overwrite"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "write_project",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "fs.write",
      "title": {
        "en": "Persist PROJECT.md",
        "ru": "Сохранить PROJECT.md"
      },
      "params": {
        "path": ".agents/planning/PROJECT.md",
        "contents": "{{recap.project_document}}",
        "mode": "non_overwrite"
      },
      "out": {
        "project_path": "string"
      },
      "skip_when": "tree.enabled != 'on' || !recap.project_document",
      "skip_out": {
        "project_path": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "add_phases",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "lp.phase_add",
      "title": {
        "en": "Register the roadmap phases",
        "ru": "Зарегистрировать фазы роадмапа"
      },
      "reads": [
        "recap.phases"
      ],
      "out": {
        "added": "string[]",
        "count": "int"
      },
      "skip_when": "!recap.phases.length || !write_roadmap.roadmap_path",
      "params": {
        "path": "{{write_roadmap.roadmap_path}}"
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "tree",
      "to": "probe"
    },
    {
      "from": "probe",
      "to": "resumed",
      "when": "probe.has_value_map && probe.has_roadmap && probe.has_profile"
    },
    {
      "from": "probe",
      "to": "value_map",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "value_map",
      "to": "write_value_map",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "write_value_map",
      "to": "preview",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "preview",
      "to": "profile_write",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "profile_write",
      "to": "ask",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "ask",
      "to": "research",
      "pass": "artifact",
      "with": {
        "owner_answers": "ctx.answers.ask"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": "research",
      "to": "write_research_stack",
      "pass": "artifact",
      "with": {
        "owner_answers": "ctx.answers.ask"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": "requirements",
      "to": "write_requirements",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "write_requirements",
      "to": "recap",
      "pass": "artifact",
      "with": {
        "owner_answers": "ctx.answers.ask"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": "recap",
      "to": "write_roadmap",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "write_roadmap",
      "to": "write_project",
      "pass": "artifact"
    },
    {
      "from": "write_research_stack",
      "to": "write_research_features"
    },
    {
      "from": "write_research_features",
      "to": "write_research_architecture"
    },
    {
      "from": "write_research_architecture",
      "to": "write_research_pitfalls"
    },
    {
      "from": "write_research_pitfalls",
      "to": "requirements",
      "with": {
        "owner_answers": "ctx.answers.ask"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": "write_project",
      "to": "add_phases"
    },
    {
      "from": "add_phases",
      "to": "done"
    }
  ],
  "test": {
    "id": "ps-1",
    "sim": {
      "input": {},
      "stubs": {
        "lp.tree_counts": {
          "enabled": "off"
        },
        "value_map": {
          "document": "# VM\n"
        },
        "preview": {
          "stack": {},
          "memory": {}
        },
        "recap": {
          "next_steps": [
            "a",
            "b",
            "c"
          ],
          "roadmap_draft": "# R\n",
          "project_document": "# P\n",
          "phases": [
            "1 a",
            "2 b"
          ]
        },
        "write_project": {
          "project_path": ".agents/planning/PROJECT.md"
        },
        "add_phases": {
          "added": [],
          "count": 2
        }
      },
      "expect_path": [
        "tree",
        "probe",
        "value_map",
        "write_value_map",
        "preview",
        "profile_write",
        "ask",
        "research",
        "write_research_stack",
        "write_research_features",
        "write_research_architecture",
        "write_research_pitfalls",
        "requirements",
        "write_requirements",
        "recap",
        "write_roadmap",
        "write_project",
        "add_phases",
        "done"
      ],
      "expect_outputs": [
        "status == 'done'",
        "next_steps.length == 3"
      ]
    }
  },
  "goal_check": "artifact"
}
